---
const { embedded = false } = Astro.props;
const TitleTag = embedded ? 'h2' : 'h1';
---
<section class="project-hero" aria-labelledby="piano-project-heading">
      <div class="project-hero__copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">Project · Browser game</p>
        <TitleTag id="piano-project-heading" class="project-title">MIDI Piano Rhythm Game</TitleTag>
        <p class="project-hero__lead">A rhythm game built around Standard MIDI charts and live piano input.</p>
        <p>Web MIDI, a local bridge, and keyboard input feed one timing and scoring system. Pixi renders the falling notes while the game core handles note matching and held notes. Charts and practice history stay on the device.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="project-section project-section--demo" aria-labelledby="piano-demo-heading">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">Demo</p>
        <h2 id="piano-demo-heading">A run from chart import to results</h2>
        <p>The recording shows the game in use, including the falling-note playfield and the practice loop that the project is built around.</p>
      </div>
      <video class="engine-demo-video" src="/media/piano-game-demo-web.mp4" controls playsinline preload="metadata" aria-label="MIDI Piano Rhythm Game demo"></video>
      <p class="project-note">MIDI Piano Rhythm Game demo.</p>
    </section>


